WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.725
The Pattern.

00:00:01.675 --> 00:00:03.662
Four Commissioners.

00:00:03.662 --> 00:00:16.812
The same institutional failures repeat: intelligence failures, political entanglement, internal accountability blackholes, reform recommendations ignored, and zero criminal accountability for leadership.

00:00:16.812 --> 00:00:22.875
No Commissioner has ever been criminally charged despite documented failures that cost lives.
